{"source":"user","type":"text","message":"**勤怠管理 — カスタムビューの内容**\n\n- どんなビューが欲しいですか？: 実働時間・賃金の集計グラフ（従業員別・月別）\n- 閲覧のみ / 編集も可能: 編集も可能（read + write）\n- 見たい項目・レイアウト・条件など（自由記述）: 承認済みのみ集計したい / 実働時間は棒グラフ、賃金は折れ線 / 特定の月をドロップダウンで選べるようにしたい / 出張日には印を付けたい など"}
{"source":"assistant","type":"text","message":"承認済のみ集計、実働は棒グラフ・賃金は折れ線、月ドロップダウン、出張マーク付きの「集計グラフ」ビューを作成します。read+write なので、選択月の「申請中」勤怠をその場で承認できるパネルも付けます（承認するとグラフに反映）。\n\nまずHTMLを書きます。"}
{"source":"tool","type":"tool_call","toolUseId":"toolu_01YFDXzMvepW193qbJkffsmQ","toolName":"Write","args":{"file_path":"/Users/ueharahisashi/mulmoclaude/data/skills/kintai/views/summary-chart.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        --bar: #4f46e5;\n        --line: #f59e0b;\n        --ink: #1e293b;\n        --muted: #64748b;\n        --border: #e2e8f0;\n        --bg: #f8fafc;\n      }\n      * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 16px;\n        color: var(--ink);\n        background: #fff;\n      }\n      header {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 12px;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        margin-bottom: 14px;\n      }\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 17px;\n        margin: 0;\n        flex: 1;\n      }\n      select,\n      input {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 6px 10px;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        background: #fff;\n        color: var(--ink);\n      }\n      label.ctl {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 6px;\n      }\n      .card {\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        padding: 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n        background: #fff;\n      }\n      .kpis {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));\n        gap: 10px;\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n      }\n      .kpi {\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        padding: 10px 12px;\n        background: var(--bg);\n      }\n      .kpi .lbl {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n      }\n      .kpi .val {\n        font-size: 20px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n      }\n      .chart-wrap {\n        position: relative;\n        height: 340px;\n      }\n      h2 {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin: 0 0 10px;\n      }\n      .trip-chips {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 8px;\n        margin-top: 4px;\n      }\n      .chip {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        background: #fef3c7;\n        color: #92400e;\n        border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        padding: 4px 10px;\n      }\n      table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        font-size: 13px;\n      }\n      th,\n      td {\n        text-align: left;\n        padding: 7px 8px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n        white-space: nowrap;\n      }\n      th {\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-weight: 600;\n      }\n      tr.trip td:first-child::after {\n        content: \" ✈\";\n      }\n      button.approve {\n        font: inherit;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        border: 1px solid #16a34a;\n        color: #fff;\n        background: #16a34a;\n        border-radius: 7px;\n        padding: 4px 12px;\n      }\n      button.approve:disabled {\n        opacity: 0.5;\n        cursor: default;\n      }\n      .link {\n        color: var(--bar);\n        cursor: pointer;\n        text-decoration: underline;\n      }\n      .empty {\n        color: var(--muted);\n        font-size: 13px;\n        padding: 8px 0;\n      }\n      .err {\n        color: #b91c1c;\n        font-size: 13px;\n      }\n      .foot {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        margin-top: 6px;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <header>\n      <h1>勤怠 集計グラフ（従業員別・月別）</h1>\n      <label class=\"ctl\">月 <select id=\"month\"></select></label>\n      <label class=\"ctl\">承認者名 <input id=\"approver\" placeholder=\"任意\" size=\"8\" /></label>\n    </header>\n\n    <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"empty\">読み込み中…</div></div>\n\n    <script>\n      const { token, dataUrl } = window.__MC_VIEW;\n      const FIELDS = \"employeeName,date,workType,businessTrip,workedMinutes,workedHours,dailyPay,status\";\n      const readUrl = dataUrl + \"?fields=\" + encodeURIComponent(FIELDS);\n      const yen = new Intl.NumberFormat(\"ja-JP\", { style: \"currency\", currency: \"JPY\", maximumFractionDigits: 0 });\n      let chart = null;\n      let selectedMonth = null; // \"YYYY-MM\"\n\n      const monthKey = (d) => (d ? String(d).slice(0, 7) : null);\n      const round1 = (n) => Math.round(n * 10) / 10;\n\n      async function read() {\n        const res = await fetch(readUrl, { headers: { Authorization: \"Bearer \" + token } });\n        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"HTTP \" + res.status + \": \" + (await res.text()));\n        return (await res.json()).items;\n      }\n\n      async function approve(id, btn) {\n        btn.disabled = true;\n        btn.textContent = \"承認中…\";\n        const approver = document.getElementById(\"approver\").value.trim();\n        const row = { id, status: \"承認済\" };\n        if (approver) row.approvedBy = approver;\n        try {\n          const res = await fetch(dataUrl, {\n            method: \"PUT\",\n            headers: { Authorization: \"Bearer \" + token, \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n            body: JSON.stringify({ items: [row], mode: \"merge\" }),\n          });\n          if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"HTTP \" + res.status + \": \" + (await res.text()));\n          const { rejected } = await res.json();\n          if (rejected && rejected.length) {\n            alert(\"承認できませんでした: \" + (rejected[0].problem || \"不明なエラー\"));\n            btn.disabled = false;\n            btn.textContent = \"承認\";\n          }\n          // success → onChange fires and re-renders\n        } catch (e) {\n          alert(\"通信エラー: \" + e.message);\n          btn.disabled = false;\n          btn.textContent = \"承認\";\n        }\n      }\n\n      function aggregate(items, month) {\n        const approved = items.filter((it) => it.status === \"承認済\" && monthKey(it.date) === month);\n        const byEmp = new Map();\n        for (const it of approved) {\n          const name = it.employeeName || \"(未設定)\";\n          const e = byEmp.get(name) || { name, minutes: 0, pay: 0, trips: 0 };\n          e.minutes += Number(it.workedMinutes) || 0;\n          e.pay += Number(it.dailyPay) || 0;\n          if (it.businessTrip) e.trips += 1;\n          byEmp.set(name, e);\n        }\n        return [...byEmp.values()].sort((a, b) => b.minutes - a.minutes);\n      }\n\n      function drawChart(rows) {\n        const ctx = document.getElementById(\"chart\");\n        if (chart) chart.destroy();\n        chart = new Chart(ctx, {\n          data: {\n            labels: rows.map((r) => (r.trips > 0 ? r.name + \" ✈\" : r.name)),\n            datasets: [\n              {\n                type: \"bar\",\n                label: \"実働時間 (h)\",\n                data: rows.map((r) => round1(r.minutes / 60)),\n                backgroundColor: \"rgba(79,70,229,0.75)\",\n                borderRadius: 6,\n                yAxisID: \"y\",\n                order: 2,\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"line\",\n                label: \"賃金 (¥)\",\n                data: rows.map((r) => Math.round(r.pay)),\n                borderColor: \"#f59e0b\",\n                backgroundColor: \"#f59e0b\",\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                tension: 0.3,\n                pointRadius: 4,\n                yAxisID: \"y1\",\n                order: 1,\n              },\n            ],\n          },\n          options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            interaction: { mode: \"index\", intersect: false },\n            plugins: {\n              legend: { position: \"top\" },\n              tooltip: {\n                callbacks: {\n                  label: (c) => (c.dataset.yAxisID === \"y1\" ? \"賃金: \" + yen.format(c.parsed.y) : \"実働: \" + c.parsed.y + \" h\"),\n                },\n              },\n            },\n            scales: {\n              y: { position: \"left\", title: { display: true, text: \"実働時間 (h)\" }, beginAtZero: true },\n              y1: {\n                position: \"right\",\n                title: { display: true, text: \"賃金 (¥)\" },\n                beginAtZero: true,\n                grid: { drawOnChartArea: false },\n                ticks: { callback: (v) => \"¥\" + Number(v).toLocaleString(\"ja-JP\") },\n              },\n            },\n          },\n        });\n      }\n\n      function pendingTable(items, month) {\n        const pending = items\n          .filter((it) => it.status === \"申請中\" && monthKey(it.date) === month)\n          .sort((a, b) => String(a.date).localeCompare(String(b.date)));\n        if (!pending.length) return '<div class=\"empty\">この月に承認待ちの勤怠はありません。</div>';\n        const rows = pending\n          .map((it) => {\n            const h = it.workedMinutes ? round1(it.workedMinutes / 60) + \" h\" : \"—\";\n            const pay = it.dailyPay != null ? yen.format(it.dailyPay) : \"—\";\n            return (\n              '<tr class=\"' +\n              (it.businessTrip ? \"trip\" : \"\") +\n              '\"><td class=\"link\" data-id=\"' +\n              it.id +\n              '\">' +\n              (it.employeeName || \"(未設定)\") +\n              \"</td><td>\" +\n              (it.date || \"\") +\n              \"</td><td>\" +\n              (it.workType || \"\") +\n              \"</td><td>\" +\n              h +\n              \"</td><td>\" +\n              pay +\n              '</td><td><button class=\"approve\" data-approve=\"' +\n              it.id +\n              '\">承認</button></td></tr>'\n            );\n          })\n          .join(\"\");\n        return (\n          '<table><thead><tr><th>氏名</th><th>勤務日</th><th>区分</th><th>実働</th><th>日額賃金</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>' +\n          rows +\n          \"</tbody></table>\"\n        );\n      }\n\n      function render(items) {\n        // month dropdown\n        const months = [...new Set(items.map((it) => monthKey(it.date)).filter(Boolean))].sort((a, b) => b.localeCompare(a));\n        const sel = document.getElementById(\"month\");\n        if (!selectedMonth || !months.includes(selectedMonth)) selectedMonth = months[0] || null;\n        sel.innerHTML = months.map((m) => '<option value=\"' + m + '\"' + (m === selectedMonth ? \" selected\" : \"\") + \">\" + m + \"</option>\").join(\"\");\n\n        const root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n        if (!selectedMonth) {\n          root.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\">勤怠データがありません。</div>';\n          return;\n        }\n\n        const rows = aggregate(items, selectedMonth);\n        const totalH = round1(rows.reduce((s, r) => s + r.minutes, 0) / 60);\n        const totalPay = rows.reduce((s, r) => s + r.pay, 0);\n        const tripDays = rows.reduce((s, r) => s + r.trips, 0);\n        const tripChips = rows\n          .filter((r) => r.trips > 0)\n          .map((r) => '<span class=\"chip\">✈ ' + r.name + \" ×\" + r.trips + \"日</span>\")\n          .join(\"\");\n\n        root.innerHTML =\n          '<div class=\"kpis\">' +\n          '<div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"lbl\">対象従業員</div><div class=\"val\">' +\n          rows.length +\n          \" 名</div></div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"lbl\">合計実働時間</div><div class=\"val\">' +\n          totalH +\n          \" h</div></div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"lbl\">合計賃金</div><div class=\"val\">' +\n          yen.format(totalPay) +\n          \"</div></div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"lbl\">出張日数</div><div class=\"val\">' +\n          tripDays +\n          \" 日</div></div>\" +\n          \"</div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"card\"><h2>' +\n          selectedMonth +\n          \" の実働時間・賃金（承認済のみ）</h2>\" +\n          (rows.length ? '<div class=\"chart-wrap\"><canvas id=\"chart\"></canvas></div>' : '<div class=\"empty\">この月に承認済の勤怠はありません。</div>') +\n          (tripChips ? '<div class=\"trip-chips\">' + tripChips + \"</div>\" : \"\") +\n          '<div class=\"foot\">✈ は出張日を含む従業員。棒＝実働時間 / 折れ線＝賃金。</div>' +\n          \"</div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"card\"><h2>承認待ち（申請中）— この月</h2>' +\n          pendingTable(items, selectedMonth) +\n          '<div class=\"foot\">承認するとグラフの集計に反映されます。氏名クリックで明細を開きます。</div>' +\n          \"</div>\";\n\n        if (rows.length) drawChart(rows);\n\n        root.querySelectorAll(\"button.approve\").forEach((b) => {\n          b.onclick = () => approve(b.getAttribute(\"data-approve\"), b);\n        });\n        root.querySelectorAll(\".link[data-id]\").forEach((el) => {\n          el.onclick = () => window.__MC_VIEW.openItem(el.getAttribute(\"data-id\"));\n        });\n      }\n\n      async function refresh() {\n        try {\n          const items = await read();\n          render(items);\n        } catch (e) {\n          document.getElementById(\"root\").innerHTML = '<div class=\"err\">読み込みに失敗しました: ' + e.message + \"</div>\";\n        }\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById(\"month\").addEventListener(\"change\", (e) => {\n        selectedMonth = e.target.value;\n        refresh();\n      });\n\n      refresh();\n      window.__MC_VIEW.onChange(() => refresh());\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"},"ts":"2026-07-16T20:20:47.353Z"}
